{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲版说清了疲惫与牵挂并存、柔软的向往如何逐渐转成推进力，以及无法挽回之事如何限制力量的释放，使他只能一次次顶住压力；但它主要以主题性概括连接这些变化，没有充分说明迟疑如何先表现为身体的停顿、每次爆发的余压如何带入下一次发力，以及末尾步伐为何从试探逐渐集中。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙版把试探的步伐联系到没有回应保证却仍未退去的靠近欲，进一步说明身体会先于明确判断而停顿、降低期待只能减轻靠近而不能消除所求、反复用力未能解除失去的可能反而使压力和身体紧绷延续，以及前进如何带来松动却不等于安心；不足是H编号和部分内心判断增加了解码负担，身体耗竭导致末尾动作倾向集中的因果也带有一定推断性。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙版保留了甲版关于柔软的向往转化为行动、压力阻止顺畅释放的核心解释，并进一步交代了身体反应、应对方式的局限、压力累积与末尾转折之间的具体机制，因此即使部分推断较密，也没有造成解释上的实质退步。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8a8d7b76-1a1a-4b1d-8ee8-ae43c27084ad", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T140236186260Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.422, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:03:23.615382+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2ec00f073de8f897586b9002f1fea6823e326e07aff4a5b3905e7ec219b94795", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f